  "dcterms:title": "The Gene Ontology (GO) Knowledgebase",
  "dcterms:description": "A BioBricks packaging of the Gene Ontology (GO) knowledgebase. The DVC download stage retrieves the ontology (go.owl, go-plus.owl), human GO annotation files (*human*gaf.gz), the GO-CAM models (GO-CAMs.ttl.zip from the geneontology-public S3 bucket) and the external2go cross-reference mappings, all from http://current.geneontology.org/. R/build.R packages these into the brick. GO is the world's largest source of structured information on gene function, produced by the Gene Ontology Consortium.",
