  "biobricks:reviewed": false,
  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by BioBricks licensing-provenance annotation agent. The brick's .bb/brick.jsonld carries no dcterms:license. dvc.yaml shows the upstream is the Gene Ontology (current.geneontology.org). The Gene Ontology citation/license policy page explicitly states GO Consortium data is licensed under CC BY 4.0. CC BY 4.0 permits commercial use and redistribution with attribution, so licenseClass=attribution and merckCommercialUse=permitted. HUMAN REVIEW: preserve CC BY attribution to the Gene Ontology Consortium (release DOI) on redistribution. Note some included resources (GO-CAMs) come from the geneontology-public S3 bucket but are covered by the same GO CC BY 4.0 policy.",
